UPDATE companies SET description='ECG Solar is a solar installation company headquartered in Anamosa, Iowa, founded in 2008. The business operates from a location near Cedar Rapids and serves residential, commercial, and municipal clients across the state.

The company provides turnkey renewable energy solutions including photovoltaic (PV) and AC-coupled PV (ACPV) system installation, Enphase battery storage integration, Kohler standby generator installation, and EV charger deployment.

ECG Solar works with homeowners, businesses, and government entities such as the City of Maysville Fire Department. Its project portfolio spans residential rooftops, commercial facilities, and municipal buildings throughout Iowa. The firm also provides tax credit consulting and energy efficiency education to help customers navigate incentive programs.

