UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 2022, Eastman Screen Printing opened in Concord, New Hampshire, as a locally owned shop. Managers Ron Dulong and Sam Mostue describe the venture as a long-held dream to bring a transparent, in-house screen printing service to the community, where customers can watch the work being done.

The company provides screen printing on apparel and tote bags using plastisol, water-based, and discharge inks; embroidery with digitizing, 3D foam, and puff styles; signs, banners, and vehicle graphics printed on weather-safe vinyl; and business printing including cards, brochures, flyers, and direct-mail services such as Every Door Direct Mail. Orders range from one piece to over 10,000, all produced in-house with rush capabilities.

Eastman serves local businesses, schools, and organizations throughout Concord and central New Hampshire. Clients have included a tree-care company, a school theatre program, and corporate customers needing branded uniforms and promotional gear.

The shop emphasizes in-house production for speed, quality, and control; full-service support from design preparation through delivery; personalized service with transparent pricing; and a commitment to the Concord community.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Screen printing (plastisol, water-based, discharge inks)", "Embroidery (digitizing, 3D foam, puff)", "Sign and banner printing (vinyl banners, retractable stands, window clings)", "Vehicle graphics (decals, full wraps, installation)", "Business printing (business cards, brochures, flyers, postcards, letterhead)", "Direct mail services (Every Door Direct Mail, mailing list preparation, postal logistics)", "Graphic design (in-shop art design)"], "industries": [], "materials": ["Plastisol ink", "Water-based ink", "Discharge ink", "Vinyl (for banners and vehicle graphics)"], "equipment": [], "volume": "1 to 10,000+ units", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house production for speed, quality, and control", "Full-service from design prep to delivery", "Personalized support with transparent pricing", "Rush capabilities on custom orders", "Proudly serving Concord & Central NH"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2022 -> homepage", "Headquarters: Concord, New Hampshire -> homepage", "Locally owned -> homepage", "Managers: Ron Dulong (homepage), Sam Mostue (services page)", "Services: screen printing, embroidery, signs/banners/vehicle graphics, business printing & direct mail -> services page", "Screen printing inks: plastisol, water-based, discharge -> services page", "Embroidery styles: digitizing, 3D foam, puff -> services page", "Sign products: vinyl banners, retractable stands, window clings, vehicle decals, full wraps -> services page", "Business printing: business cards, brochures, flyers, postcards, letterhead -> services page", "Direct mail: EDDM, mailing list prep, postal logistics -> services page", "Volume: orders from 1 to 10,000+ -> services page", "In-house productio