UPDATE companies SET description='Edge Plastics, Inc. is a family-owned injection molding manufacturer based in Mansfield, Ohio. The company was founded in 1975 by Marilyn and David Eckstein as D&M Plastics, and has remained under family control since. In 2005, their daughter Shelley Fisher acquired the business and serves as CEO, bringing an MBA from Ohio State University to the operation.

The company specializes in injection molding of industrial polymer storage products, including totes, bins, and containers for home, industrial, and office use. Its manufacturing and distribution campus spans nearly 400,000 square feet with 26 loading docks, positioned minutes from U.S. Route 30, Interstate 71, and U.S. Route 42 for rapid shipping across North America. Edge Plastics offers custom colors, private labeling, flexible ordering, and dedicated customer service.

The product line includes series such as Classic, Square, Latching, Hi-Top, Tough Totes, Big Tub!, Lock-N-Stor, and Holiday Totes, all produced in Ohio.

