UPDATE companies SET description='ElectroCraft, Inc. operates from Gallipolis, Ohio, where it designs and manufactures fractional-horsepower motors and motion control systems.

The product portfolio spans brushless DC motors, DC motor drives, linear actuators, mobility gearmotors, and integrated wheel drives such as the MPW series, which combines a BLDC motor with a planetary gearbox inside a wheel assembly. ElectroCraft emphasizes custom OEM solutions, offering configurable standard products and fully engineered designs for specific applications.

