UPDATE companies SET description='Electronic Engineering Co. has operated from Des Moines, Iowa since 1946. The company began as an electronics and communication specialist serving Iowa and Nebraska, building a reputation over 75 years for wireless communications, data, and security solutions.

The firm provides end-to-end technology solutions including system engineering, project management, installation, equipment repair, FCC licensing, tower construction, and ongoing maintenance. It also delivers vehicle upfitting, in-building wireless coverage, radio dispatch systems, GPS fleet tracking, and video security. The company manages the full lifecycle from design through deployment and support.

