UPDATE companies SET description='Elite Apparel & Promo is a promotional product distributor headquartered in Columbus, Ohio, with additional offices in Wausau, Wisconsin, and Medellín, Colombia. The company operates as a strategic branding partner for businesses seeking scalable uniform programs and branded merchandise.

The firm distributes a range of promotional items including apparel, bags, writing instruments, tech accessories, and drinkware. It specializes in managing uniform programs for organizations with five or more locations, providing consistency and quality control across multiple sites. Through a strategic partnership with a supplier based in Shenzhen, China — which maintains representation in Columbus — Elite maintains direct factory oversight to protect quality standards and improve turnaround times.

Examples include corporate uniform programs for multi-site companies, branded golf polos and accessories for tournaments, custom barware for restaurants and wineries, and promotional items for university bookstores and trade shows.

