UPDATE companies SET description='Elite Metal Fabricators, Inc. operates from Boyd, Texas, in the Dallas–Fort Worth metro area. The company has accumulated over 25 years of experience in metal fabrication, building a portfolio of more than 500 completed projects and partnerships with over 15 industry collaborators.

The shop provides a full suite of fabrication services, including custom fabrication, architectural metalwork, precision machining, structural design, specialized coatings, industrial welding, equipment installation, and on‑site fabrication. It also offers pre‑construction planning such as field measuring and advanced fabrication planning, along with site management and civil‑engineering support.

