UPDATE companies SET description='Emcee Electronics Inc is based in Venice, Florida, where it designs and manufactures instruments for measuring the electrical conductivity, water separability, and filterability of explosive liquids.

The firm''s product line consists of precision test instruments that conform to ASTM International standards, including methods D8073, D3948, and D7224, as well as standards from the Energy Institute (formerly the Institute of Petroleum) and ISO. Emcee Electronics provides technical support, training videos, and instruction manuals for its equipment.

The instruments serve customers in aviation fuel testing and petroleum product testing, where water separation and conductivity measurements are critical for flight safety and fuel quality. The company sells through a dealer network and has partnered with PAC to expand its global reach.

Emcee Electronics emphasizes that its products are 100% American made and produced under an ISO 9001:2015 quality management system. The company has published technical analysis arguing that certain ASTM test methods do not reflect real-world coalescing performance, underscoring its focus on test-method validity.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Design and manufacture of conductivity, water separability, and filterability test instruments", "Compliance with ASTM D8073, D3948, D7224 and related standards", "Technical support and training", "Dealer-based sales and distribution"], "industries": ["Aviation fuel testing", "Petroleum product testing"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["100% American made manufacturing", "ISO 9001:2015 certified quality system", "Instruments compliant with ASTM, Energy Institute, and ISO test standards", "Technical support including training videos and manuals", "Global service partnership with PAC"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Venice, Florida -> db", "Makes instruments for electrical conductivity, water separability, filterability of explosive liquids -> /", "ISO 9001:2015 certified -> /", "Products listed in ASTM International, Energy Institute, and ISO standards -> /", "Provides technical support, training videos, instruction manuals -> /", "Claims 100% American made -> /", "Joined PAC to accelerate global service -> /", "Publishes technical analysis on ASTM test methods D8073, D3948, D7224 -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We make instruments to measure electrical conductivity, water separability, and filterability of explosive liquids.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='emcee-electronics-inc' AND approved AND profi