UPDATE companies SET description='Emerald Steel Fabricators, Inc. has operated from Eugene, Oregon since its founding in 1975.

The 25,400-square-foot facility on five acres houses a full-service fabrication and machine shop. Equipment includes a CNC beam line for cutting and punching beams, channels, angles, and tees; a CNC drill line; and a large array of CNC and manual machines. The shop performs custom welding fabrication to AISC/AWS specifications and runs an enclosed paint and sandblast facility capable of applying various paint systems.

Emerald Steel primarily serves contractors and industrial clients in the Willamette Valley, providing an edge through competitive pricing, quality fabrication, and aggressive delivery schedules. Customers return for hot-rush jobs and R&D projects, relying on the shop''s ability to take projects from raw steel through finished, assembled, and painted products at a single location.

The company emphasizes problem-solving on complex projects and a loyalty-driven model built on repeat business. Its team works as a close-knit group, focusing on cost-effective manufacturing and follow-through to ensure final project goals are met.', certifications=ARRAY['AISC specifications','AWS specifications']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Structural steel fabrication", "Mechanical fabrication", "CNC machining", "Manual machining", "Custom welding fabrication", "Sandblasting", "Painting", "CNC beam line processing (cutting, punching)", "CNC drill line processing", "Machined slots and interpolated holes", "Assembly"], "industries": ["Contractors", "Industrial manufacturing"], "materials": ["Steel"], "equipment": ["CNC beam line", "CNC drill line", "CNC and manual machines", "Enclosed paint and sandblast facility"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Full-service shop: raw steel to finished painted product at one location", "Meets or exceeds AISC/AWS specifications", "CNC beam line and CNC drill line for structural shapes", "Enclosed paint and sandblast facility with multiple paint systems", "Family-owned with over 40 years of job-shop experience"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1975 -> db", "Headquarters Eugene, Oregon -> db", "Family-owned -> /about-us", "Facility: 5 acres, 25,400 sq ft shop -> /", "Services: structural/mechanical fabrication, machining, sandblasting, painting -> /", "CNC beam line for beams, channels, angles, tees -> /", "CNC drill line -> /", "Large array of CNC and manual machines -> /", "Meets or exceeds AISC/AWS specifications -> /", "Enclosed paint and sandblast facility -> /", "Serves contractors in Willamette Valley -> /", "Full-service from raw steel to finished assembled/painted product -> /about-us", "Known for hot-rush jobs and R&D projects -> /about-us", "Repeat business loyalty -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Emerald Steel is