UPDATE companies SET description='Evans Food Company was founded in 1991 in Springfield, Missouri, out of a passion for food and an entrepreneurial spirit. The company began as a manufacturer of food products for retail packaging and food service production, building a portfolio that now includes brands such as The Grove Salsa, Hopsing Gourmet Sauces, and Chill CBD Water.

