UPDATE companies SET description='Everlast Energy & Roofing was founded in 2022 in Manchester, Connecticut, by stepbrothers Josh Jackson and Alex Ciccio. What began in a small basement has grown into a local team of over 40 professionals.

The company provides a full suite of roofing and solar services for residential and commercial customers. Roofing work includes full tear-off replacements, repairs, commercial flat-roof systems (TPO, rubber), storm-damage restoration, inspections, and ventilation upgrades. Solar offerings cover custom residential and commercial installations, removal and reinstallation, repair and maintenance, battery storage, and EV charger installation. The team has completed more than 800 projects and serves over 1,200 homeowners across Connecticut.

Everlast serves Connecticut homeowners and businesses, with a focus on residential roofing and solar as well as commercial roofing systems. The company is the sole solar partner of the UConn Huskies and one of two vetted roofing providers for the university, a partnership it cites as validation of its quality. It also handles insurance-backed storm repairs for hail, wind, and nor’easter damage.

The founders started Everlast to give Connecticut families a company they could rely on for both roofing and solar, emphasizing transparent pricing, clear communication, and a 25-year transferable workmanship warranty on roof replacements. The company promotes a “one-day installation” model for solar and a five-step process designed to minimize disruption.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Residential solar installation", "Commercial solar installation", "Solar removal and reinstallation", "Solar repair and maintenance", "Residential roof replacement", "Roof repair", "Commercial roofing (TPO, flat, rubber)", "Storm damage restoration", "Roof inspection", "Ridge vent and ventilation installation", "Solar battery storage installation", "EV charger installation", "Cash purchase solar", "PPA/lease solar financing"], "industries": ["Residential roofing", "Commercial roofing", "Solar installation", "Solar maintenance", "Storm damage restoration"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["25-year transferable workmanship warranty on roof replacements", "Sole solar partner of the UConn Huskies and one of two vetted roofing providers", "Team of 40+ local professionals with over 800 completed projects", "One-day solar installation and five-step zero-stress process", "Honest pricing, clear communication, and reliable service as founding principles"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2022 by Josh Jackson and Alex Ciccio -> /", "Headquarters Manchester, Connecticut -> /", "Team of 40+ professionals -> /", "Over 800 projects completed -> /", "Serves 1,200+ homeowners -> /", "Sole solar partner of UConn Huskies -> /", "One of two vetted roofing providers for UConn -> /", "25-year transferable workmanship warranty -> /", "One-day solar installation -> /", "Services: residential/commercial roofing, solar, storm damage -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidenc