UPDATE companies SET description='Exterior Sheet Metal, Inc. was founded in 1985 in Grimes, Iowa, a suburb of Des Moines. The company began as an architectural sheet metal contractor serving the Midwest, focusing on custom fabrication and installation of sheet metal roofing, soffit, wall panels, gutters, downspouts, trim, and accessories.

